        "detailed_description": "<h1>  Developer's request for players' feedback:​</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most of this game project was developed by me alone. As a novice creator, I am clearly still immature.<br>I sincerely ask all players to provide valuable opinions about the game—this is extremely important to me.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for purchasing our game. We wish you all a pleasant life!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980000/extras/c7ca2ac8ad70c85750d0d30474d30851.avif?t=1758465410\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >✨<strong>Game Introduction​：</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destined one,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you seek the truth hidden in the shadows?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or raise your sword in defiance against all injustice?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter that special &quot;her&quot;,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amid deception and entanglement, the choices you make—</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What if you defy the entire world?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you still hold fast to your vows...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >​<strong>​&quot;Deceptive Love Ballad / The Blasphemous Maiden&quot;​</strong>​</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >—A dark fantasy romance GalGame, now begins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >​</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will step into the shoes of the protagonist &quot;Zilin SAI&quot;, gradually unraveling the mysteries of &quot;Heart City&quot; Morodo, meeting a diverse cast of characters, encountering your destined &quot;her&quot;, and embarking on a unique romantic story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>​</strong>✨<strong>Game Genre：</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AVG Visual Novel</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Word count: Approximately 120,000 words</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Total playtime: Approximately 3-5 hours</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >✨<strong>Game Features：</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>15 exquisite character illustrations and CGs</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full Chinese voice-over</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over ten captivating background music tracks</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Entirely independently produced by university students</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice acting by multiple actors and well-timed sound effects for an immersive audio experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, the game includes adorable chibi illustrations to lighten the mood!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980000/extras/276a18f561bf4b70fca62280dce8ad80.avif?t=1758465410\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope everyone enjoys our game and has a unique experience in &quot;Heart City&quot; Morodo!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980000/extras/c7ca2ac8ad70c85750d0d30474d30851.avif?t=1758465410\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >✨<strong>Game Introduction​：</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destined one,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you seek the truth hidden in the shadows?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or raise your sword in defiance against all injustice?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter that special &quot;her&quot;,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amid deception and entanglement, the choices you make—</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What if you defy the entire world?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you still hold fast to your vows...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >​<strong>​&quot;Deceptive Love Ballad / The Blasphemous Maiden&quot;​</strong>​</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >—A dark fantasy romance GalGame, now begins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >​</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will step into the shoes of the protagonist &quot;Zilin SAI&quot;, gradually unraveling the mysteries of &quot;Heart City&quot; Morodo, meeting a diverse cast of characters, encountering your destined &quot;her&quot;, and embarking on a unique romantic story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>​</strong>✨<strong>Game Genre：</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AVG Visual Novel</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Word count: Approximately 120,000 words</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Total playtime: Approximately 3-5 hours</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >✨<strong>Game Features：</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>15 exquisite character illustrations and CGs</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full Chinese voice-over</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over ten captivating background music tracks</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Entirely independently produced by university students</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice acting by multiple actors and well-timed sound effects for an immersive audio experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, the game includes adorable chibi illustrations to lighten the mood!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980000/extras/276a18f561bf4b70fca62280dce8ad80.avif?t=1758465410\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope everyone enjoys our game and has a unique experience in &quot;Heart City&quot; Morodo!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
